# src/packages/control-ui/src/features

## Purpose
Groups user-facing Control UI behavior by product feature rather than by low-level rendering primitive.

## Contents
Contains feature modules such as connections and operations, with their hooks, state coordination, and feature-specific components.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Feature modules consume the canonical API/transport and shared UI contracts and are composed by application pages/routes.

## Invariants
Network/side-effect ownership stays in feature hooks or service boundaries, UI state represents loading/error/empty states explicitly, and feature modules do not create competing API authorities.